  ('electric_machine', 5, '1891', 'Electric speed changes the craft', 'Samuel O’Reilly patented an electric tattooing machine in New York. Faster repetition helped reshape studio practice, while hand methods continued as skilled traditions in many communities.', 'Smithsonian: a revolution in tattooing', 'https://www.si.edu/collections/snapshot/revolution-tattooing'),
