| 2 | UV ink''s fluorescent compounds have historically been approved by the FDA only for non-human (agricultural/fishing-industry) uses. | community_attested | Greatist, "Are UV Tattoos Safe?"; Austin Tattoo Removal/Clean Slate Ink, "UV and Glow-in-the-Dark Tattoos" |
