| 2 | Traditions most severely disrupted by institutional power (colonial suppression, criminalization) frequently show the most active contemporary reclamation specifically in the ritual/protection and memory/authorship dimensions. | hypothesis | Subagent synthesis, cross-referencing STY-04, TEC-06 |
