## 12. Bibliography

**Primary regulatory sources**
- European Chemicals Agency (ECHA): "Tattoo inks and permanent make-up" (hot-topics page).
- Regulation (EC) 2020/2081, amending Annex XVII of Regulation (EC) 1907/2006 (REACH).

**Peer-reviewed-adjacent chemistry journalism**
